    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "body": "### Problem\n\nSee title. Caused by #40562.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n`NVIM_APPNAME=test-nvim nvim --clean +'set packlockfile?'`\n\n<img width=\"865\" height=\"561\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/500d36fd-1ce8-4fb2-a010-489605ae5f74\" />\n\n\n### Expected behavior\n\nThe \"nvim\" part of `\"$XDG_CONFIG_HOME/nvim/nvim-pack-lock.json\"` is not literal, but instead adjusts based on `$NVIM_APPNAME`, much like other options such as `'directory'`.\n\nMissed this while reviewing the original PR because I (incorrectly) assumed it was done automatically by the options system. My bad!\n\n### Nvim version (nvim -v)\n\nNVIM v0.13.0-dev-940+gd55252a3ec",
